# The pictures of parameters-and-units.md: a rectangle whose width is
# the parameter width, changed in the table; then extruded, its depth
# held at an expression of the parameter. Last, the motion study of the
# driven lid of testdata/ui/mechanism/boxlid.tlspr.
size tw 760 600
cursor on
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
click-entity 70000
key d
key esc
menu Edit|Parameters...
twmove 80 133
mark 30 122 170 22 tw
shot parameters-and-units-1-table
twdown L 80 133
twup L 80 133
edit width = 60
twmove 80 153
twdown L 80 153
twup L 80 153
edit thick = width/6
cursor off
shot parameters-and-units-2-parameters tw
# The dimension takes the parameter by name.
cursor on
move 290 150
down L 290 150
up L 290 150
down L 290 150
dbl L 290 150
up L 290 150
edit width
menu View|Zoom To Fit
menu View|Zoom Out
cursor off
shot parameters-and-units-3-dimension
# The table's value changed: the rectangle follows.
cursor on
twmove 420 123
mark 400 112 60 22 tw
shot parameters-and-units-4-edit-link tw
twdown L 420 123
twup L 420 123
edit 90
menu View|Zoom To Fit
menu View|Zoom Out
cursor off
shot parameters-and-units-5-width-90
# Extruded, the depth held, then set to the parameter thick.
key esc
key x shift
cursor on
twmove 505 128
mark 479 118 66 22 tw
shot parameters-and-units-6-held-box tw
twdown L 505 128
twup L 505 128
twmove 510 128
twdown L 510 128
twup L 510 128
edit thick
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor off
shot parameters-and-units-7-depth-thick
# The motion study of the box and its driven lid: angle driven from 0 to
# 110, a second parameter driven with it, then the study saved as one
# glTF animation.
answer no
file $testdata/ui/mechanism/boxlid.tlspr
menu File|Open...
menu Edit|Parameters...
click-tw [add a parameter]
edit gap = 2
menu Assembly|Motion Study...
click-tw #3 [change]
edit 110
cursor on
twmove 150 193
mark 28 182 350 22 tw
shot parameters-and-units-8-motion-study tw
click-tw [drive another parameter with it]
click-tw #7 [change]
edit 4
click-tw [run]
cursor off
mark 28 292 250 120 tw
shot parameters-and-units-9-two-drives tw
click-tw #2 [remove]
file $tmp/lid.glb
click-tw [run, saving each step...]
mark 412 262 82 22 tw
shot parameters-and-units-10-gltf tw
